     "text": [
      "весь test  regex v1: P=0.982  R=0.920  F1=0.950  (n=501, мат=176)\n",
      "весь test  regex v2: P=0.983  R=0.989  F1=0.986  (n=501, мат=176)\n",
      "KazSAnDRA  regex v1: P=0.994  R=0.946  F1=0.969  (n=425, мат=166)\n",
